<span style="color:Azure"><big><strong>--Kink Couture--</strong></big></span><br>
The store is dark, with neon lights shining and changing colors in tune with some 80s rock and metal that plays on the speakers. The entire store carries a strange vibe, almost as if it is unashamed of itself to the outside world. A man walks by in just leather shorts, a jacket, and a chain attached to his nipples. Another has a shirt that points down saying “Caged and plugged”. Even the workers themselves fit the vibe, with no real uniform outside of a shirt with the store’s logo on it… some of them are only wearing that. <br>
